---
<div
  id="cur"
  aria-hidden="true"
  style="position:fixed;left:0;top:0;z-index:200;width:8px;height:8px;margin:-4px 0 0 -4px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--acc);pointer-events:none;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;opacity:0;transition:width .35s cubic-bezier(.2,.7,0,1),height .35s cubic-bezier(.2,.7,0,1),margin .35s cubic-bezier(.2,.7,0,1),opacity .3s"
>
  <span
    id="cur-label"
    style="font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#fff;opacity:0;transition:opacity .2s;white-space:nowrap"
  >
    View ↗
  </span>
</div>

